@startuml
title Cleanux — AS-IS Deployment Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Angular Frontend" {
  [Angular v21.1.0] as angular
  [Standalone Components] as components
  [TauriApiService] as api_service
  [CrudService] as crud_svc
}

package "Tauri Backend (Rust)" {
  [src-tauri/src/] as tauri_src
  package "commands/" {
    [12 command modules] as cmds
  }
  package "services/" {
    [30+ business services] as svc
  }
  package "entities/" {
    [5 entity models] as ent
  }
  package "repositories/" {
    [RepositoryService] as repo
  }
}

package "Data Layer" {
  [nosql_orm] as orm
  database "JSON Files" as json_db {
    folder "app_data_dir()"
  }
}

package "System" {
  [sysinfo] as sysinfo
  [process_service] as proc_svc
  [kernel_cleaner_service] as kernel_svc
}

Angular --> api_service
api_service --> crud_svc
api_service --> tauri_src : invoke()
tauri_src --> cmds
tauri_src --> svc
tauri_src --> repo
repo --> orm
orm --> json_db
svc --> sysinfo
svc --> proc_svc
svc --> kernel_svc

note bottom of Tauri Backend
  Tauri v2.11.2 with tauri-plugin-fs, tauri-plugin-opener
  tauri-plugin-mcp-bridge enabled
  tauri-plugin-log for logging
end note

note bottom of Angular
  Bun package manager
  Standalone components with Signals
  TauriApiService wraps invoke()
end note
@enduml
